# rocky_cliff.fbio — a terrain biome: what grows where it is painted, and the ground under it.
# The format is docs/guide/30-terrain.md's "Biome files"; the editor reloads this on save.
label: Rocky Cliff
doc: 'Bare stone faces and ledges: talus piled at the foot, lichen on the rock, a
  tuft of grass or a stunted pine where soil holds.'
